# The working tree is LF today and the generated artefacts are byte-compared by
# test/parity-static.mjs, so line endings are pinned rather than left to core.autocrlf.
# Without this, a clone on a machine with autocrlf=true rewrites every file on checkout and
# the generator comparison fails for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.wasm binary
*.rar  binary
